<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission forecast for Sweden.</title>
<headline>EU Commission forecast for Sweden.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Sweden, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997   1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.1    2.6</p>
<p> Investment			5.5    3.2</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.6    1.8</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    9.9    9.4</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 2.6    1.7</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  76.5   74.7</p>
</text>
